    h1: "How stale can your dashboard get? Data freshness SLA calculator",
    seoTitle: "Data Freshness SLA Calculator for dbt and BI Refresh",
    seoDescription: "Work out worst-case dashboard staleness from connector, dbt and BI refresh schedules, find the bottleneck, and get dbt source freshness thresholds.",
    dek: "Worst-case staleness is the source lag plus, for every stage on its own schedule, its full interval and run time; a stage chained to the one before adds only its run time. Enter your connector, dbt and BI schedules to see the worst and typical staleness, whether your SLA holds, and the warn and error thresholds for dbt source freshness.",
    kind: "Calculator",
    icps: ["enterprise", "startup"],
